WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,310
Don't stand still.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,360
Go hide in the utility room first

3
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,420
Brother Li, hurry up

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,420
What are you afraid of?

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,180
These floor-to-ceiling windows are made of special materials

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,500
How can it be broken so easily?

7
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,190
I seem to have seen the shop donkey being scraped up

8
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,420
you hit someone

9
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,700
Won't you apologize?

10
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:45,750
I didn't mean it

11
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,280
This time it's serious

12
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,600
There's already water outside

13
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,320
There were also passers-by who were hit by objects.

14
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,320
Too terrible

15
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,400
latest news says

16
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,040
