19
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:07,960
Me neither

20
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:18,710
What's your name?

21
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:19,710
It's so noisy

22
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:22,070
