23
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,790
People like you die the fastest

24
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:25,670
Why don't you tell others that you are sick?

25
00:01:25,670 --> 00:01:26,710
Who is the most annoying person in the office?

26
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:27,950
Don't you have any idea?

27
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:29,830
