29
00:01:31,190 --> 00:01:32,310
Who do you think you are?

30
00:01:32,950 --> 00:01:36,420
Sister Lu Xin

31
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:38,420
I would like to call you the best mouth sticker

32
00:01:40,250 --> 00:01:41,810
Probably affected by extreme weather

33
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:43,170
There's something wrong with the signal

34
00:01:43,170 --> 00:01:45,490
There seems to be a radio in our warehouse. Let's take a look.

35
00:01:45,490 --> 00:01:47,970
That's right. The radio can receive radio stations, so look for it quickly.

36
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:50,330
I just recently filmed a period drama and used this kind of old thing, right?

37
00:01:50,330 --> 00:01:51,690
Maybe in that big prop box

38
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,180
What's the point of looking for a radio?

39
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,300
I'll go out and ask about property

40
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,380
Can I hide for the rest of my life?

41
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:21,160
Li Dajun, this idiot

42
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,480
Can't stop it

43
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:37,370
You two should run away quickly, it’s not me.

44
00:02:37,370 --> 00:02:38,570
It has nothing to do with me

45
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:39,730
He came here on his own

46
00:02:40,350 --> 00:02:41,710
It's his own reaction

47
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:52,220
It has nothing to do with me. Stop arguing. No one is dead.

48
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,220
Come and lend a hand

49
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:54,900
It would be hard to say if I get slapped by the door again.
